WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,720
He dreams of becoming a wife

2
00:00:02,240 --> 00:00:03,880
How could the Qin family let him in?

3
00:00:04,040 --> 00:00:05,160
The dream is broken

4
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:07,880
Just focus on keeping money.

5
00:00:07,880 --> 00:00:08,800
Money blocks the light

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:11,480
He took the man back to my dad's apartment when I was three years old

7
00:00:11,480 --> 00:00:13,160
Get up and make noodles by yourself when you're hungry

8
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:18,230
Have you ever done this kind of thing? You are worse off?

9
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,000
What a tragedy this is

10
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:23,520
There's more to eat here

11
00:00:24,720 --> 00:00:25,880
I cried a lot when I was little

12
00:00:26,040 --> 00:00:27,240
Whenever you cry, my dad will give you money.

13
00:00:27,560 --> 00:00:29,280
It's a pity that he had a car accident a few years ago after not crying

14
00:00:29,440 --> 00:00:30,360
He died on the spot

15
00:00:30,560 --> 00:00:32,320
My mother hugged me and went to Qin’s house to cry every day

16
00:00:32,560 --> 00:00:34,440
If the Qin family doesn't give it to me, then they'll throw me somewhere else.

17
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,160
At that time, Mrs. Qin’s wife was working as an embassy

18
00:00:36,160 --> 00:00:37,960
Pregnant with twins and two sons

19
00:00:37,960 --> 00:00:39,320
She found me useless

20
00:00:39,320 --> 00:00:40,240
Just throw me away

21
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:41,800
I was ten years old that year

22
00:00:41,800 --> 00:00:43,080
A person stands at the door of Qin's house

23
00:00:43,080 --> 00:00:44,120
Haven't eaten for a long time

24
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:45,840
When I'm so hungry that I cry

25
00:00:45,840 --> 00:00:47,040
The two brothers brought out a bowl
